<title>BRAZIL: Bovespa sees 12.205 mln reais outflow June 1-20.</title>
<headline>Bovespa sees 12.205 mln reais outflow June 1-20.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) said it has registered net foreign capital outflows of 12.205 million reais in the first 20 days of June.</p>
<p>Foreign buys totalled 4.508 billion reais, while foreign sales amounted to 4.521 million reais in the period, it said.</p>
<p>So far this year, net foreign investment in the bolsa has totalled 1.414 billion reais, it added.</p>
<p>(--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
